{
  "slug": "visual-explainer-marketplace",
  "name": "Visual Explainer Marketplace",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Plugin distribution for visual-explainer",
  "longDescription": "This entry is the repository root of visual-explainer: the marketplace (`.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`, `pluginRoot: ./plugins`) that distributes it, so installing this name delivers the distribution files, while the plugin itself lives in `plugins/visual-explainer`: a `SKILL.md`, `extension.ts`, templates and **7 commands** (`/diff-review`, `/plan-review`, `/fact-check`, `/generate-slides`, `/generate-visual-plan`, `/generate-web-diagram`, `/project-recap`) that turn terminal output into self-contained HTML pages: Mermaid diagrams with zoom and pan, diff and plan reviews, slides and data tables, in dark and light themes. Copies for Pi, Codex, OpenCode, Cursor and OpenClaw are described in the README. MIT, version 0.8.1.",
